<x-public-layout title="Terms and Conditions"><article class="container legal-content"><span class="eyebrow">A CLEAR UNDERSTANDING</span><h1>Terms and Conditions</h1><p>ATS CV offers an early-access account workspace. CV analysis, AI rewriting, document exports, and paid plans are being introduced in later releases. Features labelled upcoming cannot currently be used.</p><h2>Your account</h2><p>Provide accurate account details, keep your password private, and use the service only for documents you own or have permission to process. You can delete your account in your profile.</p><h2>AI recommendations and match estimates</h2><p>Future match scores will be estimates of alignment with a job description. They are not official employer ATS scores, hiring decisions, or guarantees of employment. AI suggestions require your review. Never use generated content to misrepresent skills, qualifications, employment, or achievements.</p><h2>Plans and payments</h2><p>The Free plan is available without payment. Basic and Pro prices describe planned subscription tiers. Live payments and paid upgrades are disabled. Viewing a plan never marks you as a paid customer.</p><h2>Availability</h2><p>Early-access features may change or be temporarily unavailable. Review and back up important career documents. Operator details and final service terms must be established before public commercial launch.</p></article></x-public-layout>
